from lesson_helpers import example as ex
DATA={
'sha':'09514e200e3e421da0dd49ebd6af3e4ec89d475d','colour':'#7441b0','first':'SignalDeviationAndRecovery',
'subtitle':('从信号偏差、报文时序到物理扰动：建立可解释的异常实验','From signal deviations and frame timing to physical disturbances: build interpretable anomaly experiments'),
'intro':[
('本库把异常条件建成可以显式配置、连线和观察的 Modelica 元件。研究对象不是抽象的“系统出故障”，而是某个接收值被偏置、某一帧被延迟、某条电路多了一条泄漏支路，或者某个物体获得了有限冲量。选择元件时首先问：我要改变的是信息，还是物理网络？','This library represents abnormal conditions as explicitly configured, connected and observable Modelica components. The intervention is not an abstract system failure: it is a biased received value, a delayed frame, an additional leakage branch or a finite impulse. Begin by asking whether the intervention changes information or the physical network.'),
('读完指南后，应能独立选择异常位置，建立未干预对照，设置激活和恢复过程，识别通信事件与保持值，并用能量、动量或信号时序解释结果。本库只声明 MSL 4.0.0 依赖，不要求同时安装其他安全资产库。','After working through the guide, you should be able to choose an intervention location, retain a nominal reference, configure activation and recovery, distinguish communication events from held values, and interpret results through energy, momentum or timing. The declared dependency is MSL 4.0.0; the other safety libraries are not required.')],
'route':[
('运行 SignalDeviationAndRecovery，区分偏置、比例误差和冻结。','Run SignalDeviationAndRecovery and distinguish bias, gain error and freezing.'),
('阅读激活参数和输出资格；比较 enabled=false 与零效果参数，不假设所有类默认启用。','Read activation parameters and output qualification; compare disabled and zero-effect settings without assuming common defaults.'),
('运行 DeterministicCommunication，同时观察发送/接收计数、源身份和队列诊断。','Run DeterministicCommunication and inspect counters, source identities and queue diagnostics together.'),
('进入一个物理域，完成对照与守恒检查，再学习 CombinedAnomalies 的串联顺序。','Choose a physical domain, check the nominal comparison and conservation, then examine serial ordering in CombinedAnomalies.')],
'concepts':[
(('异常位置决定实验含义','The intervention location determines the experiment'),'在传感器输出后插入 Bias，改变的是控制器获得的信息；在供电回路增加 SeriesResistance，改变的是实际电压、电流与耗散。二者都可能导致控制性能下降，但不能互相替代。保留真值与测量值两条观察路径。','A Bias after a sensor changes the controller information. A SeriesResistance in a supply path changes physical voltage, current and dissipation. Both may degrade control, but they are not interchangeable. Preserve separate observations of physical truth and the received measurement.'),
(('激活、效果与恢复不是同一量','Activation, realised effect and recovery differ'),'常用类提供 enabled、startTime、endTime、severity 及 transitionTime；其他类使用 eventStartTime 等字段，应查看具体声明。active 为请求状态时，有限过渡可能使效果仍在衰减。命令持续时间类的 effectActive 可以长于其接收激活窗。','Common classes expose enabled, startTime, endTime, severity and transitionTime; other classes retain fields such as eventStartTime. Inspect each declaration. A request can end before a finite effect has decayed. For command-duration replacement, effectActive can extend beyond the admission window.'),
(('离散异常不是任意比例混合','Discrete anomalies are not arbitrary fractional mixtures'),'冻结、布尔翻转和整帧操作具有离散含义；部分实现要求 severity 取 0 或 1。不能把 0.3 直接解释为 30% 丢帧概率。本库的通信规则是确定性的。','Freezing, Boolean operations and whole-frame policies have discrete meanings; some implementations require severity to be zero or one. A value of 0.3 is not a 30% dropout probability. Communication policies are deterministic.'),
(('新收到一帧不等于数值改变','A new reception is not a changed value'),'每个新输入帧使 txCount 加一；rxCount 表示接收事件。重复帧可以有相同 receivedSequence 与载荷，却是新的接收。available 表示保留输出可用，不等于这一步收到新帧；还须查看 validOut、sourceTime 和服务时钟。','Increment txCount once for each new input frame. rxCount identifies receptions. A duplicate can retain the same receivedSequence and payload while constituting a new reception. available describes the retained output, not a new arrival; also inspect validOut, timestamps and the service clock.'),
(('物理扰动要有明确通路','Physical disturbances require an explicit path'),'串联阻抗接入原通路，旁路连接两节点，热流源连接被作用热节点，排放元件连接明确的环境边界。选择过小阻抗或瞬时变化可能产生刚性数值问题；不能靠省略参考端口来模拟“理想外界”。','Insert series impedance in the original path, connect a bypass across two nodes, attach heat flow to a thermal node and connect vents to explicit boundaries. Very small impedances or abrupt changes can create numerical stiffness; omitting reference connections does not define an ideal environment.')],
'groups':[
('Signals',('测量与命令异常','Measurement and command anomalies'),'把 u 接到发送端，把 y 接到实际接收端，并保留原始值作对照。先选择偏置/比例/时序/保持等机制，再设置激活窗口；Dropout 等类还须读取有效性，NoiseInjection 的噪声必须由外部提供。','Connect u to the sending side and y to the actual receiver, retaining the original value for comparison. Choose the deviation mechanism before configuring activation. Read qualification from dropout models; NoiseInjection requires an external noise input.'),
('Communication',('确定性报文交付','Deterministic frame delivery'),'载荷、txCount、sequence、sourceTime 与 validIn 一起连接，不能只接载荷。设置 samplePeriod 和 maxFrames，读取 rxCount、接收身份、queueLength、droppedCount、overflow 与 serviceDelay。恢复时被丢弃的排队报文也应计入解释。','Connect payload, txCount, sequence, sourceTime and validIn together. Configure samplePeriod and maxFrames, then inspect rxCount, received identity, queueLength, droppedCount, overflow and serviceDelay. Include discarded queued frames when interpreting recovery.'),
('Electrical',('电气扰动','Electrical disturbances'),'根据元件角色串联或并联到明确的电气节点，并建立接地参考。区分附加功率负载、电流支路和电压源；可选热端口启用后必须接入热网络。','Connect according to the series or parallel role and provide an electrical reference. Distinguish power loads, current branches and voltage sources. Connect any enabled thermal port to a thermal network.'),
('Mechanics',('机械载荷与接触','Mechanical loading and contact'),'连接 flange 或两端 flange_a/flange_b，确认相对运动的正方向。冲量由有限幅值与持续时间实现，接触由有限刚度阻尼实现；通过速度变化、相对位移及耗散验证作用。','Connect flange or the paired flanges and establish the relative-motion sign. Impulses have finite amplitude and duration; contacts have finite stiffness and damping. Check velocity changes, relative displacement and dissipation.'),
('Thermal',('热流与环境交换','Heat flow and environmental exchange'),'热端口连接热容量或传热网络。先区分规定热功率、规定热量脉冲和有限环境换热；温度使用绝对温度，辐射项不能使用摄氏数值代入。','Connect the heat port to thermal storage or a heat-transfer network. Distinguish prescribed power, a prescribed energy pulse and finite environmental exchange. Use absolute temperatures, particularly for radiation.'),
('Fluid',('流路与边界异常','Fluid paths and boundary anomalies'),'所有流体元件采用一致 Medium，并提供 inner Modelica.Fluid.System 及必要边界。旁路、排放与外界供给要有实际连接；反向流动时检查质量流量符号和流出状态。','Use a consistent Medium and provide inner Modelica.Fluid.System and appropriate boundaries. Bypasses, vents and environmental supplies require real connections. Check flow sign and stream-state semantics under reverse flow.'),
('CrossDomain',('跨域影响','Cross-domain effects'),'分别识别守恒能量耦合与规定信号驱动：ElectricalHeating 把同一电耗散送到热端口；PressureForce 使用给定压差信号，并不是完整流体—机械能量交换元件。','Distinguish conservative coupling from prescribed signal-driven effects. ElectricalHeating routes the same electrical loss into heat; PressureForce uses a prescribed pressure signal rather than modelling complete fluid–mechanical energy exchange.')],
'examples':{
'SignalDeviationAndRecovery':ex(('同一斜坡上的偏置、冻结与增益','Bias, freezing and gain on one ramp'),('三种异常如何改变同一个测量值，恢复后是否重新跟随？','How do three anomalies alter the same measurement, and do they resume tracking?'),('ramp.y=time 分别接入三个独立支路；激活区间均为 [1,2) s，偏置 2、相对增益误差 1，过渡时间为零。','A ramp equal to time feeds three independent branches. Activation is [1,2) s, with bias 2, relative gain error 1 and zero transition time.'),('在激活区间内，biasValue=t+2，gainValue=2t，freezeValue 保持激活沿约 1 的值；区间外应恢复为 t。事件附近使用实际求解器输出确认左右极限。','During activation, biasValue=t+2 and gainValue=2t; freezeValue retains the activation-edge value, approximately 1. Outside the window, the signals return to t. Inspect event-side values in the solver output.'),['ramp.y','biasValue','gainValue','freezeValue'],('把 bias.bias 改为 -2，再将过渡时间改为 0.1；比较幅值变化与过渡形状。','Change bias.bias to -2, then set its transition time to 0.1; separate magnitude from transition shape.'),('这是三个并行独立干预，不是把三种故障同时叠加到一个信号。','These are independent parallel interventions, not three simultaneous transformations on one signal.')),
'DeterministicCommunication':ex(('四种报文交付策略','Four frame-delivery policies'),('报文丢弃、延迟、交换和重复能否从接收事件与身份区分？','Can drops, delay, reordering and duplication be distinguished from reception events and identities?'),('同一 FrameSource 每 0.1 s 产生输入；四条独立策略使用相同服务周期、容量 16。丢帧/重复每三帧执行一次，延迟为 0.2 s，交换配对超时为 0.25 s。','One FrameSource supplies inputs every 0.1 s. Four independent policies share the service period and capacity 16. Drop/duplicate occurs every third frame, delay is 0.2 s and pair timeout is 0.25 s.'),('丢帧支路身份序列缺项；延迟支路源时间与接收时间分离；重排改变先后次序；重复支路可能连续交付同一身份。不要仅凭输出数值不变判断没有新帧。','The dropped sequence contains gaps; delayed reception separates source time from arrival time; reordering changes sequence order; duplication may deliver the same identity repeatedly. An unchanged output value does not imply that no frame arrived.'),['transmitter.txCount','dropId','delayId','reorderId','duplicateId','delay.rxCount','delay.queueLength','delay.serviceDelay','duplicate.rxCount'],('增大 delay.delayTime 或减小 maxFrames，观察排队与 overflow；每次只修改一个设置。','Increase delay.delayTime or reduce maxFrames and inspect queuing and overflow, changing one setting at a time.'),('服务网格会影响实际交付时刻；这个案例不是随机网络时延分布或通信协议栈。','The service grid affects delivery times. This is not a stochastic latency distribution or a complete protocol stack.')),
'ElectricalDisturbances':ex(('并联负载与串联纹波','Parallel loading and series ripple'),('附加并联电导和串联电压扰动有什么不同？','How does added shunt conductance differ from series voltage disturbance?'),('两个独立 12 V 回路分别连接 10 Ω 电阻。第一回路在 [1,2) s 增加 0.1 S 旁路；第二回路串入幅值 1 V、10 Hz 的纹波。','Two independent 12 V circuits use 10-ohm loads. One adds a 0.1 S shunt over [1,2) s; the other inserts a 1 V, 10 Hz ripple.'),('理想电压源保持第一回路负载电压，因此参考负载电流仍约 1.2 A，附加支路约 1.2 A。第二回路负载电流出现约 0.1 A 幅值的纹波，符号相位由接线决定。','The ideal source maintains the first load voltage, so its current remains approximately 1.2 A while the added branch draws approximately 1.2 A. The second load has approximately 0.1 A ripple amplitude; sign and phase follow the connection orientation.'),['referenceLoad.i','extraPath.i','rippleLoad.i'],('修改 extraPath.G_fault，再给供电增加有限源阻抗，比较母线电压是否仍保持不变。','Vary extraPath.G_fault, then introduce finite source resistance and check whether the bus voltage remains unchanged.'),('固定电压边界下的结果不能直接代表具有内阻和限流的真实电池。','A fixed-voltage boundary does not represent every real battery with resistance and current limits.')),
'MechanicalImpulseAndContact':ex(('有限冲量与独立接触限位','Finite impulses and an independent stop'),('怎样用动量关系检查冲量模块？','How can momentum balance check an impulse model?'),('1 N·s 冲量作用于 2 kg 自由质量；0.2 N·m·s 角冲量作用于 0.5 kg·m² 惯量；第三支路由 0.3 N 推力驱动质量块接触限位。','A 1 N s impulse acts on a 2 kg free mass; a 0.2 N m s angular impulse acts on 0.5 kg m² inertia. A separate 0.3 N branch drives a mass into a stop.'),('两个自由体的速度改变量应分别约为 0.5 m/s 和 0.4 rad/s。接触支路呈现有限压缩及动态响应，不应被解释为位置瞬时夹紧。','The free-body velocity increments should be approximately 0.5 m/s and 0.4 rad/s. The contact branch exhibits finite compression and dynamics, not instantaneous position clamping.'),['forceBody.v','torqueBody.w','contactBody.s','contactBody.v'],('保持 impulse 不变，把 duration 从 0.1 改为 0.2；比较峰值作用力与最终速度改变量。','Keep impulse fixed and change duration from 0.1 to 0.2; compare force amplitude and final velocity increment.'),('动量核对仅适用于该自由体支路；接触支路含额外外力和约束。','The simple momentum check applies to the free-body branch, not the contact branch with additional forces and constraints.')),
'ThermalPulseAndEnvironment':ex(('热量脉冲与两类环境边界','Energy pulse and two environmental boundaries'),('规定热量、环境温升和辐射输入为什么形成不同曲线？','Why do an energy pulse, ambient shift and radiation produce different traces?'),('三个独立 C=10 J/K 热容分别接收 10 J 热脉冲、通过 G=0.5 W/K 的环境变化，以及与 330 K 环境的辐射交换。','Three independent 10 J/K thermal capacities receive a 10 J pulse, an ambient shift through 0.5 W/K conductance, and radiation exchange with a 330 K environment.'),('无其他损失的脉冲支路最终温升约 1 K；环境支路以有限速率趋近环境并在恢复后变化；辐射支路依赖绝对温度的非线性关系。','With no other losses, the pulse branch gains approximately 1 K. The ambient branch approaches its boundary at a finite rate and changes again on recovery. Radiation follows a nonlinear absolute-temperature relation.'),['pulseBody.T','ambientBody.T','radiationBody.T'],('保持 energy=10，将脉冲 duration 加倍；观察温升总量与加热速率的区别。','Keep energy=10 and double pulse duration; distinguish total temperature rise from heating rate.'),('这些是独立边界机制比较，不是同一个热体的总热平衡。','These compare independent boundary mechanisms, not the combined balance of one body.')),
'FluidPathDisturbances':ex(('明确边界之间的流体旁路','A bypass between explicit fluid boundaries'),('旁路开启一定会降低原主路流量吗？','Does opening a bypass necessarily reduce main-path flow?'),('恒定压力上下游之间连接主阀和独立并联 Bypass；旁路在 [1,3) s 开启，reverse 可反转压力边界。','A main valve and an independent Bypass connect fixed-pressure boundaries. The bypass opens over [1,3) s; reverse swaps the pressure boundary direction.'),('固定压差条件下，旁路增加总流量，主路压差并不因旁路自动下降。设置 reverse=true 后应检查有符号流量反转。','With fixed pressure difference, the bypass increases total flow without automatically reducing the main-path pressure difference. With reverse=true, inspect signed reverse flow.'),['mainPath.m_flow','extraPath.port_a.m_flow'],('先运行 reverse=false，再运行 reverse=true；保持其他参数不变并比较流量符号。','Run with reverse=false and then true, keeping other parameters fixed and comparing flow signs.'),('压力源固定了边界，不能把这里的主路不变结论推广到有限供压系统。','The fixed boundaries prevent generalising unchanged main flow to a finite-capacity supply.')),
'UnsafeCommandPatterns':ex(('遗漏、误发、延迟和延长命令','Omitted, spurious, delayed and prolonged commands'),('命令事件的改变与连续信号门控有什么区别？','How does changing a command event differ from gating a continuous value?'),('名义命令为 [1,2) s 脉冲；四条独立支路分别遗漏、在 0.5 s 误发、延迟 0.2 s、以 1.3 倍标称时长重构脉冲。','The nominal command is active over [1,2) s. Independent branches omit it, add a spurious pulse at 0.5 s, delay it by 0.2 s or rebuild it with 1.3 times the nominal duration.'),('遗漏模块处理激活窗内接受的整个命令，因此不能假设 1.25 s 后原命令立即恢复。延迟脉冲预期在 [1.2,2.2) s，延长脉冲约在 [1,2.3) s；误发脉冲宽 0.25 s。','Omission concerns a whole admitted command, so do not assume it returns at 1.25 s. The delayed pulse is expected over [1.2,2.2) s and the prolonged pulse approximately over [1,2.3) s. The spurious pulse is 0.25 s wide.'),['command.y','omittedValue','spuriousValue','timedValue','durationValue'],('把 omitted.startTime 移到名义上升沿之后，再比较完整命令是否被接受；改变 durationFactor 查看结束时刻。','Move omitted.startTime after the nominal rising edge and compare admission; change durationFactor and inspect the end time.'),('在线输入不能被因果地提前；提前操作只适用于已知计划的有符号时间平移模式。','An unknown online input cannot be advanced causally; advancement is restricted to the signed shift of a known plan.')),
'CrossDomainEffects':ex(('守恒电热与规定压差作用力','Conservative electrical heating and prescribed pressure force'),('如何分清跨域能量耦合与跨域信号驱动？','How do conservative cross-domain coupling and signal-driven effects differ?'),('10 V 电源驱动 R=10 Ω 的 ElectricalHeating 并把耗散送给 C=100 J/K 热容；另一支路用 100 kPa 压差和 1e-4 m² 面积产生力。','A 10 V source drives 10-ohm ElectricalHeating and routes dissipation to a 100 J/K body. A separate branch converts 100 kPa and 1e-4 m² into force.'),('电功率约 10 W，对无散热热容意味着约 0.1 K/s 温升斜率；压差力的幅值约 10 N。固定机械端使运动为零，而不是压力能量转换被完整建模。','Electrical power is approximately 10 W, giving about 0.1 K/s with no heat loss. Pressure-force magnitude is approximately 10 N. The fixed mechanical port prevents motion; it does not establish complete pressure-energy conversion.'),['heater.lossPower','body.T','force.flange.f'],('把 heater.R 加倍并比较耗散变化；把 force.A 加倍并比较力幅值。','Double heater.R and compare dissipation; double force.A and compare force magnitude.'),('不要把规定压差信号当成已经接入真实流体容腔。','A prescribed pressure signal is not a connected physical fluid chamber.')),
'CombinedAnomalies':ex(('串联干预顺序与名义直通对照','Serial ordering with a nominal direct reference'),('多个干预如何在同一信号路径上组合？','How can several interventions be composed on one signal path?'),('ramp→offset→delay→hold 串联，并保留 ramp→nominal 直通。三个干预窗口分别为 1–2、2.2–3.4 和 3.7–4.5 s。','The serial path is ramp→offset→delay→hold, with a direct ramp→nominal reference. Intervention windows are 1–2, 2.2–3.4 and 3.7–4.5 s.'),('先观察偏置段及过渡，再观察历史延迟，最后观察激活沿保持与恢复。modified 与 nominal 的差值解释整条路径的净影响。','Inspect the offset segment and transition, then delayed history, then capture and recovery. The difference between modified and nominal describes the net path effect.'),['modified','nominal','offset.y','delay.y','hold.y'],('在副本中让偏置与冻结窗口重叠，再交换 offset 与 hold 的位置。','In a copy, overlap bias and freeze windows and swap the offset and hold order.'),('模块串联通常不满足交换律；比较时必须记录连线次序和各模块的内部状态。','Serial transformations are generally non-commutative; record connection order and internal state when comparing them.'))
},
'study':[
('建立自己的异常实验时，先复制一个结构最接近的案例到独立研究包。明确异常注入位置、输入真值、接收值、激活条件和结束条件。先关闭干预确认名义轨迹，再启用一个干预，不要第一步同时打开多种异常。','For a new study, copy the closest example into a separate study package. Declare the injection location, physical truth, received value, activation and termination. First confirm the nominal trace with intervention disabled; then introduce one mechanism at a time.'),
('下面的独立模型只演示偏置接入。结果变量 sensorPath.y 是接收值，truth.y 是原始值。之后可以把 sensorPath.y 接到自己的控制器输入；不能继续把控制器接到 truth.y 而又声称已经完成干预。','The independent model below demonstrates bias insertion. sensorPath.y is the received value and truth.y is the original. Connect the former to the host controller; leaving the controller on truth.y would bypass the intervention.')],
'snippet':'''within;
model MyBiasStudy
  Modelica.Blocks.Sources.RealExpression truth(y=time);
  AnomalyLibrary.Signals.Bias sensorPath(
    enabled=true, bias=2, startTime=1, endTime=2, transitionTime=0);
equation
  connect(truth.y, sensorPath.u);
  annotation(experiment(StartTime=0, StopTime=4, Tolerance=1e-6));
end MyBiasStudy;''',
 'trouble':[
(('没有出现异常效果','No visible anomaly'),'先检查 enabled、时间窗、severity 和外部触发是否正确；再检查接收端是否真正接到了异常模块 y，而不是仍接名义信号。条件端口未启用时不能随意连接。','Check enabled, the time window, severity and external triggering, then confirm that the receiver uses the anomaly output rather than the nominal path. Do not connect a conditional port that is disabled.'),
(('噪声为什么没有随机变化','Why is noise not varying randomly?'),'NoiseInjection 读取外部噪声信号，本身不提供随机过程。必须明确噪声来源、种子或记录回放和采样规则，才能进行可复现比较。','NoiseInjection consumes an external noise signal; it does not generate a random process. Specify its source, seed or replay record, and sampling rule for reproducibility.'),
(('通信输出不变是否意味着断链','Does a constant communication output mean link loss?'),'检查 rxCount、available 和 validOut。保持上次载荷、重复同值报文和没有接收事件是不同情况；只看一条 y 曲线无法区分。','Inspect rxCount, available and validOut. Holding a previous payload, receiving a duplicate value and receiving nothing are distinct; a y trace alone cannot distinguish them.'),
(('物理回路出现大幅尖峰或求解失败','Physical spikes or solver failure'),'检查理想源冲突、浮置节点、过小阻抗、冲量宽度与初始储能。保留必要有限阻抗并做参数尺度分析，不能把所有瞬态都当作真实损伤预测。','Check conflicting ideal sources, floating nodes, very small impedance, impulse duration and initial energy. Retain appropriate finite impedance and examine parameter scales; not every numerical transient predicts physical damage.'),
(('结果可否直接说明事故概率','Can the result establish accident probability?'),'不能。这里的时序和异常幅值是所选条件；若要概率结论，必须额外定义样本空间、概率模型和统计方案。本库不会自动完成这些工作。','No. The timing and magnitudes are selected conditions. Probabilistic conclusions require a separately defined sample space, probability model and statistical procedure.')]
}
